# TCP ports a ihost may answer as OPEN from its LAN (GA_LAN_IFACES). ALLOWLIST, pinned from the
# reviewed policy in buildroot-external/rootfs-overlay/usr/libexec/ga-firewall-gate (NOT from a scan):
#   HOST_ALLOW_TCP=22222 (sshd, on-site diagnostics), CONTAINER_ALLOW_TCP=80, 8123 (HA Core UI).
# Which of them answer depends on what listens (Core 2026.10 serves :80, older Core :8123).
# Any other open port fails; everything else must be filtered (default deny). Changing this = security review.
80
8123
22222
